event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":87,"item_id":"rs_02e31b37df6f0cea016ac9e43442a487d2ab45e1456ba12e44","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing basic API and SPA**\n\nI'm planning to implement a basic API along with a single-page application (SPA) that covers all static routes. I need to ensure that tests are conducted for the Node built-in spawn and verify database persistence without relying on browser tools. I’ve realized that using textContent helps with escaping. I’ll also create a button for asynchronous actions, and set an error role alert for notifications. It seems like a straightforward approach!"}

